---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../components/Nav.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Global CGPA"
  description="Privacy Policy for Global CGPA: what we collect (almost nothing), how calculations stay on your device, and how Google AdSense and Analytics are used."
  canonical="https://globalcgpa.in/privacy-policy"
>
  <SiteHeader />

  <main class="max-w-[780px] mx-auto px-6 py-14" style="flex:1;">
    <div class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-500 mb-2">Legal</div>
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-3">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400 text-sm mb-8">Last updated: August 2026</p>

    <div class="space-y-6 text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed text-sm">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-6">1. Zero Personal Data Collection</h2>
      <p>
        Global CGPA is built with a privacy-first approach. We do not require any account registration, email submission, or personal details to use our calculator tools. We never sell or share personal information, because we do not collect it in the first place.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-6">2. Client-Side Processing</h2>
      <p>
        All calculations (CGPA, SGPA, percentage, GPA conversions) are computed locally inside your browser using client-side JavaScript. None of your grades, credits, or calculator inputs are transmitted to our servers or stored externally.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-6">3. Analytics</h2>
      <p>
        We use Google Analytics 4 to understand aggregate usage of the site — which pages are visited, how long pages take to load, and general traffic sources. This data is aggregated and does not identify you personally. You can opt out of Google Analytics using <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" class="text-emerald-500 underline" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Google's official opt-out browser add-on</a>.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-6">4. Advertising (Google AdSense)</h2>
      <p>
        This site is free to use and is supported by advertising delivered through Google AdSense. This section explains what that involves:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
        <li>
          <strong>Third-party vendor cookies.</strong> Google and its partners use cookies or device identifiers to serve ads based on your prior visits to this or other websites. You can read how Google uses data from partner sites in <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" class="text-emerald-500 underline" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Google's Privacy &amp; Terms</a>.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Personalised advertising.</strong> Google may personalise ads based on your browsing history. You can turn off ad personalisation at <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" class="text-emerald-500 underline" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Google Ads Settings</a>, or manage industry opt-outs at <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" class="text-emerald-500 underline" rel="noopener" target="_blank">aboutads.info</a>.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>What we do not do.</strong> We do not use pop-up or full-screen interstitial ads, we do not place ads inside calculator input areas, and we do not run any ad networks other than Google AdSense.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-6">5. Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        The site itself stores only one small preference in your browser's local storage: your light/dark theme choice. This is functional, not tracking. Advertising and analytics cookies are set by Google as described in sections 3 and 4, and are governed by their policies.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-6">6. Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>
        The site is intended for students and does not knowingly collect any personal information from any visitor, including children under 13.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-6">7. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this policy as the site evolves. Material changes (especially to advertising practices) will be reflected in the "Last updated" date above. Continued use of the site after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated policy.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-6">8. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>
        If you have questions regarding this privacy policy, you can contact us at <a href="/contact" class="text-emerald-500 underline">support@globalcgpa.in</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>

  <SiteFooter />
</Layout>
